Package: locfit
Version: 1.5-9.12
Title: Local Regression (WebAssembly namespace stub)
Description: A minimal stub that provides the 'locfit' namespace so that DESeq2
    can be loaded and run with parametric dispersion estimation entirely in the
    browser (webR). It does not implement local regression; local dispersion
    fitting is unavailable in this build. The upstream 'locfit' package does not
    cross-compile to WebAssembly, and DESeq2 only imports the single symbol
    'locfit' for its (non-default) local fit path.
Authors@R: person("RNA-seq Lab", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@rnaseq-lab.invalid")
